    "chunk_text": "mel nemne\u00f0, swa mearwe, Hyt \u00fe\u00e6t gewana\u00f0 & gewislice geh\u00e6le\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 wifes flewsan genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte croppas swa mearwe, & \u00fe\u00e6ra syn \u00feriwa seofeone, seo\u00f0 Wi\u00f0 heortece genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte leaf gecnucude \u00feurh hy sylfe, lege ofer \u00feone wynstran tit. \u00de\u00e6t sar tof\u00e6r\u00f0. Wi\u00f0 niwe wunda genim \u00feysse sylfan wyrte blostman, lege to \u00f0am wundum. Butan \u00e6lcre yldincge & frecenysse hy \u00fea wunda geh\u00e6la\u00f0. Wi\u00fe li\u00fea sare genim \u00feysse ylcan wyrte sumne d\u00e6l, seo\u00f0 on wine to \u00feriddan d\u00e6le, & of \u00feam wine syn Ealle \u00fe\u00e6ra li\u00f0a untrumnysse hyt geli\u00f0iga\u00fe. Wi\u00f0 n\u00e6ddran slite genim \u00feysse ilcan wyrte leaf \u00fee we erusti nemdun swa niwe gecnucude, lege to Gearwe millifolium. \u00d0as wyrte \u00fee man millefolium & on ure ge\u00feeode gearwe nemne\u00fe, ys s\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t Achilles se ealdorman Eac heo of sumum mannum for \u00fey genemned ys achylleos. Mid \u00fe\u00e6re wyrte ys s\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t he eac sumne man geh\u00e6lan sceolde \u00feam w\u00e6s Thelephon nama. Wi\u00f0 to\u00f0ece genim \u00feysse wyrte wyrtwalan \u00f0e we millefolium nemdun, syle etan f\u00e6stendum. Wi\u00fe wunda \u00fee mid iserne syn geworhte genim \u00feas ylcan wyrte mid rysle gecnucude, lege to \u00feam Heo \u00fea wunda afeorma\u00fe & geh\u00e6le\u00f0. Wi\u00fe",
